1
00:00:00,509 --> 00:00:02,389
(Raj:)I'm not pouting, I'm brooding.

2
00:00:03,145 --> 00:00:04,855
(Raj:)Which is how sexy men pout.

3
00:00:07,383 --> 00:00:09,023
(Amy:)It actually was kind of fun.

4
00:00:09,184 --> 00:00:10,634
(Raj:)You're just saying that.

5
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:13,070
(Leonard:)Yeah.

6
00:00:15,524 --> 00:00:16,974
(Bernadette:)I liked the time travel element.

7
00:00:17,126 --> 00:00:18,666
(Raj:)Thank you.
I thought it was inspired.

8
00:00:18,827 --> 00:00:20,667
(Leonard:)It was. By Terminator.

9
00:00:22,231 --> 00:00:24,641
(Bernadette:)Well, I hope 20 years from now,
we really are all still together

10
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,900
(Bernadette:)and still friends.

11
00:00:26,068 --> 00:00:27,238
(Penny:)-Definitely.
-Of course.

12
00:00:27,403 --> 00:00:28,713
Hey, how about this?

13
00:00:28,871 --> 00:00:30,871
Whether we're friends, not friends,

14
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,920
scattered around the world,
no matter what,

15
00:00:33,075 --> 00:00:34,855
let's all promise to meet
in front of this building

16
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:37,220
exactly 20 years
from tonight at 8:00 p.m.

17
00:00:37,379 --> 00:00:38,919
And have dinner
like we always do.

18
00:00:39,081 --> 00:00:40,681
Aw, I love it.

19
00:00:41,317 --> 00:00:42,417
(Leonard:)Putting it in my phone right now.

20
00:00:42,584 --> 00:00:44,064
(Penny:)Yeah, me, too.

21
00:00:45,321 --> 00:00:46,991
(Stuart:)My phone doesn't have a calendar.

22
00:00:51,427 --> 00:00:53,427
It's all right,
I'll just write it on my hand.

23
00:00:56,365 --> 00:00:57,775
(Raj:)And it's done.

24
00:00:57,933 --> 00:00:59,103
(Penny:)Yup, we're all in.

25
00:00:59,268 --> 00:01:01,748
(Bernadette:)All right,
I'll see you guys in 20 years.

26
00:01:09,511 --> 00:01:11,031
(Stuart:)I knew it.

